2026-09-12T11:24:13.7244973Z > # CRAN guard
2026-09-12T11:24:13.7245139Z > #
2026-09-12T11:24:13.7245469Z > # The duckdb test suite exercises DuckDB's bundled C++ engine, which is too heavy
2026-09-12T11:24:13.7245941Z > # for CRAN's check farm, and checks were very fragile in the past. We therefore
2026-09-12T11:24:13.7246405Z > # keep it off on CRAN but run it automatically on GitHub Actions (GITHUB_ACTIONS)
2026-09-12T11:24:13.7246855Z > # and on r-universe (MY_UNIVERSE). An explicit DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS opts in
2026-09-12T11:24:13.7247513Z > # (true-ish) or out (false-ish) and always wins; otherwise we fall back to those.
2026-09-12T11:24:13.7248046Z > # This check is intentionally inlined here (rather than calling into the package)
2026-09-12T11:24:13.7248455Z > # so the guard is obvious and self-contained.
